WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The screw rotates in place. The guided nut and carriage begin moving along the axis.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lead is travel per revolution: 2 mm in this example. The separate guide carries lateral loads.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Twenty-five revolutions give 50 mm travel. At the separate target speed of 20 mm per second, the screw would need 600 rpm.
